KFSplitView compatibility
-------------------------

The historical KFSplitView v1.3 was Copyright (c) 2003-2004 Ken Ferry,
with contributions by Kirk Baker and John Pannell, and carried CC BY-NC 1.0
(http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/1.0/). No alternative permission
has been established. Its notices remain in the compatibility files; neither
the Horos LGPL heading nor the Swift conversion relicenses the old algorithm.

This fork replaces that algorithm with an independently authored Swift/AppKit
implementation by Thales Matheus M Santos (ThalesMMS), Copyright (c) 2026,
under LGPLv3. The public class name, selectors, notification names, exported
KFOffScreenPoint and version-2 saved-position format remain for compatibility.
The old random integer scaler, cursor lookup and event/layout engine are no
longer incorporated. Retained historical notices are attribution, not a claim
of permission to redistribute the removed implementation under LGPLv3.

